mk("family-and-friends","festivals-and-celebrations-with-friends","Sharing, helping and playing with friends","friendship","Mira helped a new neighbour carry her bags.\n\"Friends help each other,\" said her mother.",["Family members and friends care for one another. We share, help and play together.","New friends can be made by smiling and including everyone.","Being kind to everyone makes our community happy."],["friend","kind","share"],Q("A good friend is","kind and helpful","rude","angry","Friends share and help.","Friends should never help.","friend","friend"),"Friends are kind and helpful.",["Friends help and share.","Be kind to all."])
