mk("celebrating-festivals","festival-customs-and-living-together","Customs and living together in festivals","festivals","Mira's neighbours of different faiths visited each other at festival time.\n\"Festivals bring us together,\" said her teacher.",["India celebrates many festivals like Pongal, Diwali, Eid and Christmas.","People decorate homes, wear new clothes, share food and visit each other.","Festivals teach us to respect everyone's customs."],["festival","custom","respect"],Q("Festivals teach us to","respect each other","fight","stay alone","People share food in festivals.","Only one festival is celebrated in India.","festival","festival"),"Festivals bring people together.",["Respect all festivals.","Share the joy."])
mk("getting-to-know-plants","uses-of-plants-in-our-life","Uses of plants in our life","plants","Mira ate a mango and sat in the shade of its tree.\n\"Plants give us so much,\" she said.",["Plants give us food, shade, wood, medicines and cotton.","Fruits, vegetables and grains come from plants.","We should plant trees and not harm them."],["fruit","shade","wood"],Q("Plants give us","food and shade","nothing","only noise","Cotton comes from plants.","Plants give us nothing.","shade","shade"),"Plants give food and shade.",["Plants are useful.","Plant trees."])
mk("plants-and-animals-live-together","a-forest-home-for-many-living-things","A forest: a home for many living things","a forest","Mira saw a squirrel on a tree and ants below.\n\"The tree is a home for many,\" she said.",["A forest is full of plants and animals living together.","Trees give homes, food and shade to birds, insects and animals.","If we cut forests, animals lose their homes."],["forest","habitat","home"],Q("A forest is home to","many living things","no animals","only robots","Birds live in trees.","Cutting forests helps animals.","forest","forest"),"A forest is a home for many.",["Forests are homes.","Protect trees."])
mk("living-in-harmony","kindness-to-animals-and-sharing-space","Kindness to animals and sharing space","kindness","Mira kept a bowl of water for birds on her balcony.\n\"Everyone needs water,\" she said.",["We share the Earth with animals, birds and plants.","We can be kind by giving water and food to birds and not hurting animals.","Living in harmony means taking care of everyone."],["kind","care","share"],Q("To be kind to birds we","give water","throw stones","scare them","Birds need water.","We should hurt animals.","kind","kind"),"Be kind to animals.",["Share the Earth.","Care for animals."])
mk("water-a-precious-gift","water-cycle-and-clean-water","Where water comes from and clean water","water","Mira saw rain fill the pond.\n\"Where does rain come from?\" she asked.",["Water evaporates from oceans and rivers, forms clouds and falls as rain.","Clean water is needed for drinking. We boil or filter water to make it safe.","Dirty water can make us ill."],["rain","cloud","clean"],Q("Rain comes from","clouds","rocks","trees","Rain fills ponds.","Dirty water is safe to drink.","rain","rain"),"Rain comes from clouds.",["Water comes from rain.","Drink clean water."])
mk("food-we-eat","food-from-plants-and-animals","Food from plants and from animals","food","Mira had milk and a banana for breakfast.\n\"Milk comes from animals, the banana from a plant,\" said her mother.",["Some food comes from plants like fruits, vegetables and grains.","Some comes from animals like milk, eggs and fish.","A balanced meal has different kinds of food."],["milk","grain","egg"],Q("Milk comes from","animals","plants","stones","A banana is a fruit.","Eggs come from plants.","milk","milk"),"Food comes from plants and animals.",["Food has two sources.","Eat a balanced meal."])
mk("staying-healthy-and-happy","feeling-happy-and-looking-after-ourselves","Feeling happy and looking after ourselves","health","Mira played with friends and slept well.\n\"I feel happy,\" she said.",["Being healthy means a strong body and a happy mind.","Play, sleep, good food and friends keep us happy.","Talk to someone we trust when we feel sad."],["healthy","happy","sleep"],Q("To stay happy we","play and sleep well","skip meals","stay up late","Sleep keeps us healthy.","Talking never helps.","sleep","sleep"),"Play and rest keep us happy.",["Health is body and mind.","Talk when sad."])
mk("this-world-of-things","natural-and-made-things","Natural things and things made by people","things","Mira compared a stone and a plastic toy.\n\"One is natural, one is made,\" she said.",["Natural things like stones, water and wood come from nature.","Made things like chairs and toys are made by people.","Many made things use natural materials."],["natural","made","material"],Q("A stone is","natural","made by people","a toy","Chairs are made by people.","Water is made in a factory.","material","material"),"Some things are natural, some are made.",["Natural vs made.","Materials come from nature."])
mk("making-things","tools-and-helpers-who-make-things","Tools and the people who make things","tools","Mira watched a potter use a wheel.\n\"Tools help us make things,\" he said.",["People use tools such as a wheel, hammer or needle to make things.","Potters, tailors and carpenters are craftspeople.","Their work is useful and takes skill."],["tool","potter","craft"],Q("A potter makes","clay pots","clothes","roads","A tailor uses a needle.","A hammer is used for sewing.","tool","tool"),"Tools help make things.",["Craftspeople use tools.","Respect their work."])
